## 12. HUMAN-IN-THE-LOOP & APPROVAL MODES

### Approval Policy

**Configuration** ([core/config.schema.json](codex-rs/core/config.schema.json)):

```toml
[approvals]
policy = "suggest" | "auto_edit" | "auto" | "manual"
reviewer = "guardian" | "app_server"
```

**Modes**:

| Mode | Behavior |
|------|----------|
| `suggest` | Model proposes changes; user reviews before execution |
| `auto_edit` | Auto-apply non-interactive edits (file changes); ask for shell |
| `auto` | Execute everything without prompting (high trust) |
| `manual` | Always ask before any tool use (low trust, dev mode) |

### Approval Flow

**Orchestrator**: [tools/orchestrator.rs](codex-rs/core/src/tools/orchestrator.rs)

```
Tool call received
    ↓
with_cached_approval():
    ├─ Check if key already ApprovedForSession → skip
    ├─ Else fetch() → approval decision
    └─ Cache for future same-key calls
    
Approval decision:
    ├─ ApprovedForSession → Execute
    ├─ ApprovedOnce → Execute + ask again next time
    ├─ Denied → Skip tool call (return error)
    └─ DeferredForNetworkApproval → Continue after network check
```

### Guardian Review Framework

**Location**: [core/src/guardian/](codex-rs/core/src/guardian/)

- Central approval review system
- Supports multiple reviewers:
  - User (TUI popup)
